text Text_InsideOfTruck_GameInit_ConfigSettings_Difficulty_Normal_Description {
    "{COLOR GREEN}{SHADOW LIGHT_GREEN}Normal Mode{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{SHADOW LIGHT_GRAY} has more challenging\n"
    "trainer battles with updated teams.\p"
    "There have been updates to Pok\emon,\n"
    "Abilities, Items, and Moves.\p"
    "There is a hard level cap, and Boss teams\n"
    "will scale with the Player's team.\p"
    "The player is not allowed to access the\n"
    "the Bag during trainer battles.\p"
    "Additionally, battle style is set to Set.\p"
